'''Part-Time Coworkers''' (バイト仲間, ''Baito Nakama'', '''Part-Time Coworkers''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 7.4 Update|Version 7.4]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 2.

==Effect==
Unit Defense UP (Sm): Cats' health increases by 10%.

